<title>UK: Northumbrian Water yr pretax up 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Northumbrian Water yr pretax up 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		 126.1		  vs 111.2</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    147.4		  vs 144.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   509.6		  vs 512.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British water group is Northumbrian Water Group Plc, a unit of France's Lyonnaise des Eaux SA. The company was formed last year from the merger of North East Water Plc and Northumbrian Water Ltd. The comparative data are proforma figures.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
